   9:Inc/transport/usb/usb_role_ready_wait.hpp ****  * readFrame must already have witnessed ACK release. Otherwise an initial
  10:Inc/transport/usb/usb_role_ready_wait.hpp ****  * low level could still be the ACK, so retain the full legacy settle time.
