  12:Inc/transport/usb/usb_role_ready_wait.hpp ****  * then high therefore identifies its Application-ready pulse. Missing that
  13:Inc/transport/usb/usb_role_ready_wait.hpp ****  * pulse is harmless: keep the same 150-ms fallback and validate CAPS later. */
