 417:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  *   complete-report capacity through GET_WEBCONFIG_CREDIT and consumes that
 418:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  *   one slot across all BoardLink fragments. The slot is returned only after
 419:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  *   the report has completed USB EP1 IN, or after an explicit transport reset.
 420:../common/usb_board_link_protocol.h ****  * - Other channels retain one-credit-per-fragment behavior.
